<title>USA: Granite Financial stake raised by group.</title>
<headline>Granite Financial stake raised by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Kramer Spellman L.P., a Fort Lee, N.J., investment firm, said Tuesday it raised its stake in Granite Financial Inc to 12.67 percent, or 472,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought a net 19,000 shares between December 20 and January 3 at prices ranging from $8.875 to $9.385 a share.</p>
